# --- Local-only working material (kept on disk, not in the repo) ---
# Report and design docs, the evaluation dataset and its results, and the
# engineering rules. The repo tracks source only; `make eval` and `make seed`
# read data/evaluation and therefore work locally but not on a fresh clone.
# This also covers local database archives written by `make db-dump`.
docs/
data/
AGENTS.md
